  </div>
  <div class="ed-automation-grid">
    <article><span class="ed-capability-icon">◉</span><h3>AI call reception</h3><p>Answer approved routine questions, collect a callback request and direct complex conversations to an admissions representative.</p></article>
    <article><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌘</span><h3>Website chat assistant</h3><p>Help visitors find course details and request information, with transparent AI disclosure and human escalation.</p></article>
    <article><span class="ed-capability-icon">↺</span><h3>Missed inquiry recovery</h3><p>Route unanswered inquiries to a queue and coordinate consent-based follow-up instead of losing track of them.</p></article>
    <article><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>Admissions CRM</h3><p>Track program interest, source, response status, consultations, applications and verified enrollment where appropriate.</p></article>
  </div>
  <div class="ed-automation-demo">
    <div class="ed-demo-top"><span>ADMISSIONS ASSISTANT / CONCEPT DEMO</span><i>ILLUSTRATIVE</i></div>
